<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.RequestSimulatorData(RegionName: string, Data: number): uuid`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`key llRequestSimulatorData(string RegionName, integer Data);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Requests <b>data</b> about <b>region</b>. When <b>data</b> is available the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event will be raised.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Key/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a>) for a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event response.</p>
</p>
